# Evidence bundle of the era verification suite.

Every file in this directory except this one is generated by a run of the
browser suite and is intentionally ignored by git:

- `era-matrix.json`, `era-pixels.json`, `era-perf.json`, `era-perf-tiers.json`,
  `era-perf-high-baseline.json`, `era-audio.json`, `era-camera.json`,
  `era-accessibility.json` — the statistics, measurements and camera states
  behind every assertion;
- `era-<year>.png` — the pinned-camera frames the pixel comparison is made on
  (overlay hidden, so the year label cannot contribute to the difference);
- `era-1945-repeat.png` — the same-era control pair;
- `frame-<year>.png` — full-viewport captures for the human art-direction review.

A clean run regenerates all of them.
